      <h1 id="endpoints-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">Endpoints [v1]<a href="#endpoints-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>Endpoints is a collection of endpoints that implement the actual service. Example:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"   Name: \"mysvc\",\n   Subsets: [\n     {\n       Addresses: [{\"ip\": \"10.10.1.1\"}, {\"ip\": \"10.10.2.2\"}],\n       Ports: [{\"name\": \"a\", \"port\": 8675}, {\"name\": \"b\", \"port\": 309}]\n     },\n     {\n       Addresses: [{\"ip\": \"10.10.3.3\"}],\n       Ports: [{\"name\": \"a\", \"port\": 93}, {\"name\": \"b\", \"port\": 76}]\n     },\n  ]"} lang="plaintext" />
      <p>Endpoints is a legacy API and does not contain information about all Service features. Use discoveryv1.EndpointSlice for complete information about Service endpoints.</p>
      <p>Deprecated: This API is deprecated in v1.33+. Use discoveryv1.EndpointSlice.</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
      <h2 id="_specification" class="group scroll-mt-20">Specification<a href="#_specification" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
